  "details": "So from what i have noticed about being able to see fallbacks.\nI have noticed when u join a lobby and if someone is above your fallback safety settings it loads the original avatar the person is wearing before loading in the fallback.\nThis can cause a lot of lag depending on the instance size it can lag someone out, but also if a person is wearing some sort of crasher avatar that avatar would be loaded first before the fallback causing people to crash.\nIf there is a way to change this like how they grey robot is i think it would be good because there would be less crashing and having to deal less with lagging badly for some users.",
